<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20250719T225100" id="311bf653-30ed-4d65-a49b-1d9bc7012bab">
    <XRef DateTime="20250719T224917" id="326d3bbb-277d-4966-b8b4-fc0c38660087"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a488fde7-6082-42fa-92bd-4b5a9a50030d">
      <SceneProperties Length="10 3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DORIS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="EDWARD">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WALTER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>PHILLY ROWHOUSE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0da677fe-5a2f-48b4-9ebe-4e2d37e91171">
      <Text>A quote projects: “History repeats itself, but in such cunning disguise that we never detect the resemblance until the damage is done. - Sydney J. Harris, Chicago Sun-Times”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="812c586b-bb88-44f7-8e02-36f7183c1ef8">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="d184d215-0078-4325-bcd5-94bcc0e9d1ca">
      <Text>(Rubbing his temples)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="01b8bdf2-c160-448e-86b7-0b7293060116">
      <Text>Doris. Please. Just give me the "too long; didn't read" version. Is this going to ruin my Tuesday or my entire year?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="2d92fc91-e5ad-4e21-9b4b-2d80232b146e">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="0b73bd08-b02f-462d-92c5-fdfcd2a13e80">
      <Text>It’s not a tweet, Edward. It’s a land deed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a4623af4-3e10-4fac-b3ee-fb69b3e5e210">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="bd573ec9-496b-4d0b-9b0c-83af9b83a500">
      <Text>(Leaning over her shoulder)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="ef10f6de-3af6-4c6e-9765-ce216d8179d7">
      <Text>It’s a bribe. Call it what it is.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="fa8d8789-4a7d-438c-a25a-e855e3d5fce3">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="251ecfcb-2df5-4c7b-8bb0-886d19dcc50c">
      <Text>Is it a bribe? Or is it just... 18th-century networking?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="4c802376-a1e0-43e3-8f5b-512a2a459834">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="c846b62b-ab75-4bde-9cc7-cefd221d836c">
      <Text>He took the land meant for the veteran’s hospital and put his own name on the fence. While he was out there signing the Declaration. That’s not networking. That’s a heist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="bf3da239-8a53-464c-82e2-0bf894404309">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="9b7805ee-c31f-4bfb-b4a2-d506c5816f73">
      <Text>(To Walter)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="8fea2912-8dfb-43b9-8c07-6943bc97f949">
      <Text>And you. You’re already writing the headline, aren't you? You’ve got that look.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="2b5b2f3f-161d-498d-b9f7-63643039b886">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="4b62ac08-0a57-4f54-926b-b32cb6f7cb37">
      <Text>It’s a good look. It’s called "doing my job."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="bd4bf6f3-fcc1-4659-b6e7-2c38441aaa89">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="d5da5972-125e-4cf1-946e-c6d0c25ffd17">
      <Text>(To herself)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="d01ac354-9bd9-409e-8cf0-0dada330069b">
      <Text>I’ve written three books on this man. I called him the "Architect of Integrity."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="ec164e16-22c3-423a-9826-4eeed620423d">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="a3f7a9b7-70e1-4422-8e72-79b7769c70c0">
      <Text>And you can keep calling him that! Look, the 250th anniversary is in two days. People want to drink beer, watch fireworks, and feel okay about being American for five minutes. Why do you have to kick the legs out from under the table right now?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="23133c10-ec6a-4bcc-bc79-48da1508dab0">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="c159cab3-5e55-413f-af03-130055abdbf5">
      <Text>Because the table is crooked, Edward!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="f7bccf46-8a63-490f-bfaf-431928948761">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="7079cb72-0392-4242-bd23-275d5202751d">
      <Text>(To Doris)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="71770ae1-6dfe-4068-824f-7ff9ac2ec3c3">
      <Text>Don't let him get in your head. He’s just thinking about the press release.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="bf8841a5-05be-4cef-822a-5e9a8fb6eb58">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="5bbccd1f-6c26-4594-9f80-4a85f070bcb7">
      <Text>I’m thinking about the riot! Have you seen the news lately, Walter? People are looking for a reason to hate each other. You hand them this? You’re handing them a match.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="d18f13cf-544d-460b-9490-6a23477719c0">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="93bda2e6-8fae-4dbd-a9ba-cfd8b3a63b2e">
      <Text>So we just lie?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="ee411e6d-23b4-4049-b7b4-e6fdd9693e17">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="4123fa50-1c37-4602-8011-0c5373713f11">
      <Text>We "curate."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="48cccba8-a25d-4367-abb6-aa56ff5db43c">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="9d6f8723-871d-469c-94a6-2281181bb94c">
      <Text>I didn't spend forty years in the basement of this building to "curate" a lie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="b9f01aca-93ad-417f-b789-31734853c492">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="25d479b2-be8f-43aa-b0d0-30830b4e817f">
      <Text>(Grabbing his phone)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="9ffbd802-8676-419b-b1c0-7235c2ef3160">
      <Text>I’m calling my editor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="0ac97314-6039-4122-b844-04ec482e2163">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="cae810ec-ae19-4e2e-b67b-6c345b4122d7">
      <Text>(Blocking his path)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="4f9ed1df-7512-4cf4-ace7-d66cf476c90b">
      <Text>Sit down, Walter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="9899a6d9-5ca5-49b3-af00-e48f3bf05ec1">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="4b67aec5-3e60-4567-9b61-3e0455a33e23">
      <Text>Get out of my way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="96ae8cc0-f577-4e49-a46b-5e01b0f235d0">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="0a86b495-c845-4712-b920-f7bbeb69ae00">
      <Text>Doris, tell him. Tell him what happens to your "historical truth" if the whole country decides they don't care about history anymore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="4ed3d074-50c2-4e30-b259-2b735c783a0e">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="6a091fc4-5841-4b23-a7e1-ee65fdde2d70">
      <Text>(Staring at her gloves)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="d051f3f7-1aa2-4495-9ac2-55cc4dcf8446">
      <Text>If I publish this, my first three books become fiction. I’ll spend the rest of my life in the "Correction" section of the journals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="e17442ea-b4e4-4774-b3a4-2025ce45dd57">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="d92264d2-9ae5-4607-aaf6-6912d2e3c07b">
      <Text>Exactly. You’re not just blowing up a statue, Doris. You’re blowing up your own career. Stay quiet, and we just... we let the anniversary happen. We celebrate the man we thought he was.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="3a8399f9-f2f5-451a-bb34-21ee90ac2182">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="c788911b-f995-43a3-a264-6b5c08546fcb">
      <Text>(Stopping at the door)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="60e6908e-0272-4d10-8c83-b59184b4e49e">
      <Text>Oh, that’s beautiful, Edward. "The man we thought he was." You should put that on a t-shirt. Or a tombstone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="5fcacd7c-9a11-4b52-ad51-a24868486d88">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="0f4bb366-1da6-4cd3-ba66-8cb3fea7150a">
      <Text>I’m being practical!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="2f2c42d7-8be4-4499-8c6b-6892d487b048">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="2015f271-68cb-484f-8f00-3a8e83d5aa0b">
      <Text>You’re being a coward. (To Doris) Don't listen to him. Your reputation is fine. You found the truth. That’s what historians do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="2b88ee2e-3ac2-4278-ae01-ce21d0f90244">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="eef62c89-3853-4034-b28a-b4ec1685a95c">
      <Text>Is it? Or do we just find the parts that make us feel better about where we ended up?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="e540c690-5127-4926-b0d2-d0a324352279">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="f0356063-1612-4813-a1ab-19a287b0e585">
      <Text>(Voice softening, sensing an opening)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="d84d086d-818f-4a10-a458-a7d405147690">
      <Text>Look, the 250th isn't about 1776. It’s about 2026. It’s about giving people a reason to look at their neighbors and not want to throw a brick. If you give Walter this file, he’s going to turn it into a circus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="ff3a0ffd-950c-4750-8ba4-dc9cd742ce0e">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="52068062-e9b2-4b4e-97ca-4d21adb68362">
      <Text>It’s not a circus, it’s a newsroom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="4619a32f-6319-455e-9da1-eae3ff50da3e">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="acf16392-dcd7-47ff-8952-0867ccc71f5b">
      <Text>Same thing. Different tent. (Back to Doris) One week. Just give me one week of peace. After the fireworks are over, after the speeches are done... then you can be the "Honest Historian."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="e94ce906-0d99-460f-90f3-f21b6eca72d0">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e6aef568-85e9-47a7-8da6-aee1ff1d692e">
      <Text>The ink will still be the same in a week.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="8ff430af-32d5-4d0f-9a73-bcea2b7d39cf">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="c17509eb-1751-4359-b4ac-2776ddb05a38">
      <Text>No, it won’t. In a week, Edward’s office will have "leaked" a different version. They’ll mud the water. They’ll find a way to make this look like a forgery.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="828a0564-8031-487c-910b-a025f31fbd8a">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="04fe6dd7-141c-4bbd-a6e4-567cdef7b4f1">
      <Text>(To Walter)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="d85e2960-3bcd-4486-acb0-a51c0b4c9fee">
      <Text>You’re giving me too much credit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="546ab621-f380-4b81-9302-192754c420f2">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e64129ce-9796-4a97-a7a6-00f750e8e807">
      <Text>I’m giving you exactly enough. (To Doris) If we don’t go now, we don’t go at all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="0c41d334-e841-405e-b632-b7311c9034ef">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="93b3e5bb-10fb-48c6-871b-e0c54c303e90">
      <Text>(Looking at the ledger)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="a06547e3-f19f-44da-9a20-7d6ac0ab439b">
      <Text>He looks so small in this handwriting. Just a man trying to get a head start on the neighbors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="28a232b8-d1ac-4274-a5b2-e71f919bd863">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="1832c696-a726-4382-8dc5-d3da266cd1e5">
      <Text>(Quietly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="3484d48e-884c-47ee-a4b2-8aa9e9b62f24">
      <Text>Every giant is just a man if you get close enough. Don’t let the world get this close, Doris. They can’t handle it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="c2c40edb-ba75-4246-a9eb-79c48fc7ecb4">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="fa9d7eb8-d424-4e4f-989a-e04a26718ac1">
      <Text>(Checking his phone, frowning)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="673dbb6d-b97a-4d63-a2a0-d479a42e554b">
      <Text>Wait. Why am I getting a ‘No Service’ icon? We’re in the middle of Manhattan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="7a761d91-4178-48be-b734-c81d1b790802">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="bea679f4-fafe-4504-b87e-0422429536e2">
      <Text>It’s a basement, Walter. Thick walls. Lead paint.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="7dc90334-4175-463f-bf17-f9e4e0b1be80">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="482f38b8-24fd-48a5-b592-1c8b87301417">
      <Text>(Walking toward the door)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="7679994c-85a7-4220-a22c-7282b54a931c">
      <Text>I had three bars ten minutes ago. (He tries the door handle. It’s locked.) Edward. Why is the door locked?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a6740393-1d9f-4dab-81c8-bc1be34156de">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="f5d54fd9-9006-4129-aeb1-4e2035aa2845">
      <Text>The archives lock automatically at two. It’s for the humidity.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a0d6d35c-a928-4dae-bdb4-90b1474573c4">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="aa26b0cd-da91-41eb-92b8-c0e044668ab0">
      <Text>(Banging on the wood)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="615d5afe-503e-4969-b9a0-a052a658d5ca">
      <Text>No. No, I know that sound. That’s a deadbolt. (He spins around) You called it in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="5692ca7a-169e-4869-9b22-a8895ff55969">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="3b15f316-c6a6-434c-8c96-487c2c01841f">
      <Text>I didn’t call anything in. I made a suggestion to the Head of Security.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="fa3f56cd-bb38-41a7-b689-4a9ab5d20566">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e7945979-e41d-4585-b4ae-bae4e44045e5">
      <Text>You locked us in with a federal document? That’s a felony, you suit!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="b8a08f9d-0ca1-4d57-9d25-e7debc5a1eef">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e4e10b19-188f-4ae4-a88b-0cbf7a89f3cb">
      <Text>It’s a "cooling-off period." Think of it as a meditation retreat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="f7714ea1-f6dd-440e-a176-bddbadcffe37">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="a27b1ef3-5712-4d46-950e-dc6525a5c104">
      <Text>(Still looking at the ledger)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="08025bb5-6361-4c71-97b3-33a2e3f08f07">
      <Text>My father always said the truth would set you free. He didn't mention it came with a cage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="b54a42d6-71cd-49a3-a788-65eaad6b8e83">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="960805aa-9bdb-40ad-ac67-397d0613c451">
      <Text>Doris, look at me. In six hours, my team starts the 'Morning in America' social blitz. If Walter sends that photo, the algorithm picks it up, the hashtags start, and by noon, the 250th anniversary is a protest march.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="279a264b-4784-47b1-81c5-b47a686caba4">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="c4581336-d976-4198-9dfc-624fbf33eb54">
      <Text>(Lunging for Edward)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="a98fb378-6ec9-45d9-94e8-4c17eeca89b2">
      <Text>Give me your phone. I know you have a satellite override. Give it to me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="8c7e77e9-3b97-477a-8495-e49d47565bc0">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="234a36c7-7842-45c9-a9f8-a1a6f1c63945">
      <Text>(Backing away, hands up)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="c0550328-2c2e-4885-ba93-837b59be8e14">
      <Text>Get back! Walter, stop! You’re going to lose your press pass before the sun comes up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="48ffdbca-c84f-4f23-b4fa-7fb037751b55">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="082dbcee-4088-403a-9caf-aac7f0714cec">
      <Text>I’ll lose more than that! My editor is already looking for a reason to replace me with an AI bot that doesn't ask for health insurance. If I miss this—if I let you bury this—I’m done.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="17542fc8-885d-46ba-accf-1149b4e7ce3e">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="5e161816-89ab-47d8-b57c-9a0da2ec1933">
      <Text>(Loudly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="2127e62c-db6b-445e-bc82-5dccfb7af58f">
      <Text>Stop it! Both of you!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a9b4348b-6fab-46bd-8929-e8efa65dda19">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="3251dd35-011c-4ea0-9469-020672d10dc2">
      <Text>(Moving away)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="18e06574-bd66-4be8-b34c-a9ac8d613be3">
      <Text>Sit down, Walter. Have some water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="52b9b108-ac8e-4015-bbe1-a8b6fcb69ea6">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e7966c00-0bd8-4428-aa91-cfe69c2e8b10">
      <Text>Give me the phone, or I’ll start screaming loud enough for the night guards to think there’s a terrorist in the vault.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="ea867019-e37b-4792-9cf1-00e15ebe44dc">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="7a6cc025-77ff-497c-abfe-cf3532ade470">
      <Text>Go ahead. They’ll just zip-tie you and put you in a holding cell until the fireworks are over. You want to spend the anniversary in a precinct or on a press riser?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="5f23ff29-a2ee-4235-b4ef-51c5a6ef3eca">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="5fca1580-3dcc-488e-9339-996499e41036">
      <Text>(Quietly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="9f245828-9814-457c-81e1-76db0def98ba">
      <Text>Stop it. Both of you. You’re acting like this belongs to you. Like it’s just a "story" or a "brand."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a647e8e4-66cb-4a03-829b-57c5aa528728">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="835bf607-b78b-426c-95ee-e1761af2da39">
      <Text>It is a story, Doris!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="0895eaa8-0bd1-4667-8603-b67b7dcc3642">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="4ed4e147-1cfd-4563-b0af-9c4da571e436">
      <Text>It is a brand!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="eb767d22-be56-4d87-9d3c-65fe35a004ff">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="b467f41f-287e-4e67-a419-0d0a5ad1d60c">
      <Text>It’s a man’s life. And it’s the bridge we’ve all been standing on for two and a half centuries. If we burn the bridge to stay warm tonight, where are we going to walk tomorrow?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="5c39e8b3-0d8f-4214-8f2b-37798340b6dc">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="6b8a1a01-7876-453d-9a27-a8fdc0e1bb85">
      <Text>(Checking his watch)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="0efb07df-8383-40d9-9a7e-fc0c502e1ec0">
      <Text>Three hours. In three hours the press pool gathers at the Battery. I’m supposed to be on that bus.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="f48cf138-a03f-46d9-83a4-9f0dbf0b528d">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="f4747e09-6d73-4816-af4a-b29fd27117d2">
      <Text>You’re not getting on the bus, Walter. You’re staying here until I can get a team to "verify" that ledger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="f6fb8a38-46a0-4562-b7ec-d1570f6a3e3d">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="620383f4-4063-40bd-a9bd-2695df7a53ac">
      <Text>"Verify?" You mean sanitize.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="3094bc98-8c06-4998-9e13-432bf031f12e">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="b55cb4d7-f732-4dbb-8518-e0d75593b110">
      <Text>I mean protect the peace! You think the people out there on Broadway—the ones who haven't had a raise in five years, the ones who are looking for any excuse to tear down the next statue—you think they want a lecture on 18th-century land speculation?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="61f4e036-d12e-45e7-bc4f-e3a46a84f3e8">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="2ebdca3b-aed9-4d97-9f03-7e944cd6753d">
      <Text>(Touching the paper)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="df857931-eb66-4322-b906-3f6fa11b0646">
      <Text>It’s not speculation. It’s the blueprint.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="ad1d2591-e927-4e0b-9898-7b71d7c3dab9">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="8d4e9f2f-19e2-4e0f-bddc-f268fe56c20c">
      <Text>(To Doris)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="db6dd477-eea2-472d-a21e-55e0a3095c13">
      <Text>Give me the ledger. I’ll put it under my coat. We’ll wait for the guards at six, I walk out, I go straight to the office.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="be726728-e729-45bb-a83b-8c56b01448c6">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="76114c9d-e20e-4203-8adb-1ce511ed4fd8">
      <Text>You won't make it to the revolving door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="3d4ab22c-ab61-4de4-a8b5-86958440f570">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="3ec1599c-5245-42d6-8ec2-70853bc29eec">
      <Text>Is that a threat?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="cd80efad-3b41-4a31-ae2d-fceb4f578b8a">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e53bb5dd-ad62-4b9c-85da-f2c6c55162c2">
      <Text>It’s a forecast! Look at the street, Walter. There are snipers on the roof of the Stock Exchange. The city is a fortress today. You walk out of a federal vault with "stolen" property during a Tier 1 security event? You’re not a journalist anymore. You’re a target.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="38cc6230-914c-4ac8-923b-2841dd7b51ef">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="a699d3c5-77bc-478d-ad0d-3574c5df065d">
      <Text>(Looking up)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="1982c82e-590f-48f4-bca1-56565f71d236">
      <Text>Is that what we’ve become? Targets or liars?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="fbe045af-6851-4614-8bd7-5291e5e86448">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="6f14a44c-362f-4d48-aa8f-e5ee7e93ee9e">
      <Text>(Stepping closer to her)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="fef4a947-b201-4fdf-bcdb-d61ccd4f95d9">
      <Text>Doris, listen to me. Tomorrow—today, actually—the country needs to breathe. They need to hear the bells, see the flags, and believe, just for twenty-four hours, that the foundation is solid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a7f80761-2b84-45aa-88c0-94106b3cb803">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="9cf25b9c-18ea-42d7-96ef-c2fd74a472f0">
      <Text>Even if it’s built on a swamp?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="d92edfd1-132f-4185-bce9-68c672cc9025">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e365c2fe-7da6-42e1-8524-a29c6fdf1bce">
      <Text>Especially because it’s built on a swamp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="e6f8da54-a4f4-45c3-8575-b1465e3800a9">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="18b864bd-cefa-4947-b67b-004dab71f9f2">
      <Text>(Closing the book)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="c8ad4baa-d858-4764-8984-0996f438e56b">
      <Text>The ledger stays.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="1cee9746-bf4b-4d24-b264-1a5283b9bac6">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="92a04c70-dcad-453d-9b1c-8b477da182df">
      <Text>Doris, no.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="68278318-f7b4-43af-905d-dba3a2b8d2a6">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="fe1e7fc6-76b9-4033-ab30-ec716dc61697">
      <Text>It stays. But I’m not hiding it, Edward. I’m filing it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="c1789efb-d563-4eb7-bb5e-9672efe6cf10">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="4146f10a-b8c8-47f5-b0ae-cede26618d5b">
      <Text>Filing it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a8aabe47-0479-492b-839c-cb0df9537867">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="27e4f22e-368f-4eaf-b1e4-767f545bd189">
      <Text>Under the "Unprocessed" records. Misfiled. Box 402. Deep in the stacks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="2d180385-aa3a-4411-97ce-ea3142f97cab">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e31f28b6-8fe2-4223-94bf-3a88a3cf0ec1">
      <Text>You’re burying it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="3ee60e5a-9178-47a4-9d4d-7f59453ee9ed">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="3007b230-3f32-468c-b180-c37caf324863">
      <Text>No. I’m leaving it for a version of us that’s brave enough to read it. Because right now? (She looks at them both) One of you wants to use it like a bomb, and the other wants to pretend it’s a ghost. Neither of you actually wants the truth. You just want the leverage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="19ef7b0b-2909-4cb8-9722-2df6dba257c0">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="0b184a50-b665-4267-80f5-b08baba107f2">
      <Text>(Bitterly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="7c104030-fff7-4ca4-843c-ec48d365d3ff">
      <Text>I want the headline.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="99b0f5ca-a4a0-4ed1-8990-f343b5c17d9c">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="8136402c-d8f2-4ba8-8553-215b443bcbda">
      <Text>I want the parade.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="66d8b08e-f386-4edf-9961-0d042691bded">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="b46bd43b-d1e6-4700-868d-48c16bdfb629">
      <Text>(Picking up the box)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b798ee34-8e9a-409a-a261-8a32db46dce4">
      <Text>And I want to be able to look at the statue tomorrow without feeling sick. (She starts walking into the dark stacks) Now help me find a shelf no one looks at. We’ve got two hours until the world wakes up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="fb0aa9a7-1cfc-42f3-9afd-4285275f3dfb">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="0d238243-2b55-4cf1-a2aa-33dd88179767">
      <Text>(Following her into the dark)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="0c58bbf4-8db7-4317-b3e4-08270c955126">
      <Text>You’re burying the lead, Doris. Literally. Box 402? That’s where history goes to die.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="6f0aa799-cc86-40b7-b195-bce034920a49">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="ef8ed644-05a5-448e-9a98-d435545fedad">
      <Text>(Voice echoing)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="8d1dd245-8c1f-4312-962a-c9cf08fbb566">
      <Text>It’s where it waits, Walter. There’s a difference.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="1a94910f-5ee4-4e28-b920-cea0f5df770c">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="5325283c-14a1-4510-8685-9f0a7b2bcfa9">
      <Text>(Adjusting his cuffs, exhaling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="8c377846-68c4-4778-9534-acf7a6b0ae1c">
      <Text>It’s the right move. For the city. For the morning. I’ll make sure the security feed for this sub-level has a... "glitch" between 2:00 and 6:00 AM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="4c43a0b0-dd41-41a3-9673-e6b9949e8ca1">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="0602abaa-fc84-47f7-ac29-56f8faa90155">
      <Text>(To Edward)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="743d78e9-f0e5-4478-922b-dcb9f6e61ff8">
      <Text>You’re already erasing us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="72c49e77-29f0-4acb-be7d-3d48943a2ba6">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="522725ee-799b-4073-81cb-2b51b693e6ad">
      <Text>I’m protecting the brand. (To Doris) You’re sure about the box? No digital trail? No "accidental" cell phone pics?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="2ee08b9b-387d-4029-bf4d-a737885aa2d4">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="393e887c-d99e-433f-9c6b-88412a7bca9e">
      <Text>(Stopping at a shelf)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="b2128a01-9c53-450e-8b95-441efeda32c9">
      <Text>The paper is 250 years old. It’s survived fires, wars, and men like you, Edward. It can survive a few more decades of silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="1f6092a7-f526-4880-b194-7b323f4642fc">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="d7459950-23e1-44b9-a471-3462b9dc8975">
      <Text>(Leaning against a metal rack)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="cbf25cc6-a6a8-4f2b-9e36-f629057c87e9">
      <Text>What do I tell my editor at 4:00? "Sorry, Chief, the revolution was a typo?"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="e1562b24-4347-4d21-9d77-e1764f49520f">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="29290f33-4ef8-4246-a7f2-5dc528a0dcc0">
      <Text>Tell him the source flaked. Tell him the lead went cold. I’ll give you an exclusive on the President’s speech. Page one. "A Vision for the Next Century."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="ae84a435-51b2-4ad7-9c1f-169b012be77a">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="47689cf7-7979-4156-994e-6cb275118853">
      <Text>(Spits)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="d55470a5-8ddb-48be-bac9-270fd1870bf5">
      <Text>I’d rather write the weather report.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="02804705-3db4-4d28-9604-652088829888">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="86b54f49-412b-4a7d-a73a-4b4615638e14">
      <Text>(Lifting the box onto a high shelf)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="fc6467df-1831-4824-88ba-beed831b1a5a">
      <Text>The weather is "Cloudy with a chance of denial," Walter. (She slides the box in. It hits the back of the shelf with a heavy thud.) There. July 10th, 1776. Filed under 'Miscellaneous Land Disputes.'</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="d1e7bdaf-4435-4a0e-9d67-8b21de974fbd">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="55bf4515-2379-44f7-927f-ff49965f311e">
      <Text>(Looking at his phone)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="4789a66e-9915-4102-9ac9-86e56ab50edb">
      <Text>Signal’s back. One bar. The jammer must have a timer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="dda0ddd1-0a56-4516-a98f-1957034e7737">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="9b2cc29d-2c5b-43f7-8cb2-1dfbebde3458">
      <Text>(His phone pings incessantly)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="f2c55ce8-146b-4ec0-b40f-67f05354eb85">
      <Text>Twenty-two texts. My office is screaming. (He looks at the dark shelf where the box is hidden) We’re really doing this? We’re just... letting the parade happen?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="abd0baef-7414-48e7-8405-a562bf8e06fd">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="5654eec4-7054-4faa-9a3d-aa83b088db16">
      <Text>(Taking off her white gloves)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="2435db69-1dbb-4323-ac52-4aeefb984bd5">
      <Text>The parade was always going to happen. We just decided whether or not to throw a brick at the lead float.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="eb8335c9-e4c9-41ee-8b0a-76a729894f08">
      <Text>EDWARD</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="74b7fde3-4c7d-4f9c-9607-db267c29a227">
      <Text>(Straightening his tie, heading for the exit)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="87adb474-d51f-43d8-97fe-50bc7727b902">
      <Text>I’ll see you at the Battery. I’ll get you a VIP pass, Doris. Front row for the fireworks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="fcb7aa9a-c6bc-48cf-af1b-221f82ee5c49">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="e768056b-71bd-4a31-89c3-ec746bacb2b1">
      <Text>No thank you, Edward. I think I’ve seen enough light for one night.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="27531166-bf16-4815-ae34-ee9bba747643">
      <Text>WALTER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="8ab65f06-553f-4f7b-8e02-50ecc5ef86fa">
      <Text>(To Doris)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="b2a8bfd5-a678-450f-b04b-94fd44d5c122">
      <Text>You think anyone will ever find it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.50" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Character" id="a7950b79-3c60-4c48-bec0-316ab7cf9d20">
      <Text>DORIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="ef9729dc-f44d-4a03-a465-2026e1d6613f">
      <Text>(Walking toward the light of the hallway)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="2.50" RightIndent="6.00" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Dialogue" id="797f49f3-2e53-48c1-9148-701dfcd5bfc8">
      <Text>Someone always finds it, Walter. That’s the problem with the past. It doesn't stay Yesterday. It’s always waiting for Tomorrow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="-0.10" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="3.00" RightIndent="5.50" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Parenthetical" id="bf97c715-904f-40e8-a495-493c89a6dda3">
      <Text>(The sound of a heavy metal door unlatching. A distant police siren begins to wail from the street above—the start of the 250th-anniversary security detail.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.50" RightIndent="7.50" SpaceBefore="24" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="Scene Heading" id="4fa68a32-1354-48cc-aa0e-4a40f518f896">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="11" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>[BLACKOUT]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="89a1380f-398e-48eb-a433-535f21a0beba"/>
  </Content>

